  @contract  the gate is fxHostAtCursor -- a cell that runs no chain of its own answers nil  @ 3739
  @contract  the window is the viewport's rows, resolved on the producer's own channel  @ 3740
  @contract  notes[colIndex][row] = tm's record by reference; note columns only; first onset wins  @ 3774
